#: blakken/templates/business.html:3
msgid "Restaurant ordering, made simple | Blakken"
msgstr "Restaurantbestilling, gjort enkelt | Blakken"

#: blakken/templates/business.html:7
msgid "A better way to serve your guests"
msgstr "En bedre måte å servere gjestene dine på"

#: blakken/templates/business.html:8
msgid "Your restaurant. Your menu. Your app."
msgstr "Din restaurant. Din meny. Din app."

#: blakken/templates/business.html:9
msgid ""
"Blakken gives restaurants their own customer app and a shared management app "
"for menus and orders."
msgstr "Blakken gir restauranter sin egen kundeapp og en felles administrasjonsapp for menyer og bestillinger."

#: blakken/templates/business.html:10 blakken/templates/business_base.html:15
#: blakken/templates/signup.html:7
msgid "Register your restaurant"
msgstr "Registrer restauranten din"

#: blakken/templates/business.html:14
msgid "Your own customer app"
msgstr "Din egen kundeapp"

#: blakken/templates/business.html:15
msgid ""
"Give guests a dedicated app for your restaurant, with your menus and "
"ordering."
msgstr "Gi gjestene en egen app for restauranten din, med menyer og bestilling."

#: blakken/templates/business.html:18
msgid "One place to manage"
msgstr "Alt på ett sted"

#: blakken/templates/business.html:19
msgid "Use the shared management app to keep menus and orders up to date."
msgstr "Bruk den felles administrasjonsappen for å holde menyer og bestillinger oppdatert."

#: blakken/templates/business.html:22
msgid "You stay in control"
msgstr "Du har kontrollen"

#: blakken/templates/business.html:23
msgid ""
"Create an account to request access. Our team activates each restaurant "
"before it goes live."
msgstr "Opprett en konto for å be om tilgang. Teamet vårt aktiverer restauranten før den blir synlig."

